window.products.push({"id":806005,"name":"Super Soft Warm Cozy Throw Blanket Lightweight Flannel Wearable Blanket for Bed Couch Sofa Chair Home Decor, Floral Flowers Bull Terrier Dog Mint Gree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnV9krczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A soft flannel blanket for a wide range of applications. Warm blanket will make you comfortable to take a nap in the office. On a cold night you can lie on the sofa with a warm blanket and watch TV. When you are on a business trip, put a blanket in your suitcase that is light and practical. It can also be used as a summer air conditioning blanket and a children's crawling blanket. There are many places where you can use this soft and warm blanket. If you want an incredibly comfortable blanket, our throw blanket is a choice you can't miss. High Quality Ultra soft premium fabric (100% anti-pilling flannel fleece) to provide you with the most luxurious comfort. Beautiful pattern printed outside, inside is colored white. Three Sizes Available 50x40 inches, 60x50 inches, 80x60 inches. Our blanket fits all to keep you cozy and warm from head to toe! Unique Design The fashion pattern design make the blanket easily coordinate with your home decor and turn your home into a stylish place. Simply drape it over a sofa, couch, chair or across the end of beds to add extra texture to your living room or bed room. Multipurpose Our blanket is perfect for winter to just wrap them, watching TV, lounging on sofa/bed, reading, studying, sleeping, snuggling, camping and napping. Just choose your favorite now. Perfect Gift Perfect for family and friends as Valentine's Day/Birthday/Mother's Day/Father's Day/Thanksgiving/Christmas/New Year gifts. Easy To Care Machine wash or hand wash in cold water, tumble dry on low heat, do not use bleach. Please Note 1.Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 2.Please allow 1-3 cm difference due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnV9krczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SWEET TANG","source_asin":"B09K7DLMR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7DLMR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7DLMR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
