window.products.push({"id":806200,"name":"Real Deal Steel Pint Glasses - Stainless Steel Beer Tumblers - Set of 4 Insulated Cups for Outdoors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716e-mHpm0L._AC_SL1480_.jpg","description":"KEEPS BEER ICY-COLD: Unlike cheap single-wall cups, this sweatproof stainless steel drinking tumbler is double-walled to retain the temp of what’s inside. To take it even further, Real Deal Steel double wall stainless steel cups have copper vacuum insulation between the walls that allows the cups to be slim while keeping your drinks cold for hours. DURABLE & SHATTERPROOF: These food-grade stainless steel cups are a great alternative to breakage-prone glass and flimsy plastic. Use them at home or for camping, the pool, the beach, picnics and boating. NO LIP MEANS NO GRIME: Our unique tumblers have no rolled lip around the rim, which means no nasty buildup. You’ll also love that they’re easy to care for NOT JUST FOR BEER: Real Deal Steel true pint cups are versatile. Use your steel pint glasses for wine and cocktails, shakes, floats, smoothies, coffee, hot chocolate, tea & more. The electropolished interior doesn’t retain or impart flavors like a standard brushed interior. STACKABLE: Unlike other tumblers, Real Deal Steel pints stack neatly into cabinets and, fit nicely into beach bags. The slim design feels great in the hand while still maintaining amazing insulation. With the assorted pack, there is no mistaking which drink is yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716e-mHpm0L._AC_SL1480_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Real Deal Steel","source_asin":"B084ZRX4MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084ZRX4MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084ZRX4MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
