window.products.push({"id":806403,"name":"Chef HanDol Air Fryer Parchment Liner, Multipurpose Non-Stick Parchment Paper, Baking, Roasting, Frying, Air Fryer, Microwave, Oven, Steamer (Medium -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ed4xN5KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STOP TEARING, FOLDING, CUTTING AND BENDING – Now you do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend. Here's a parchment that is bowl shaped to fit your Airfryer. You just take one out, put it in and you're ready to cook. MADE IN FRANCE ECO-FRIENDLY NATURAL PULP PRODUCT – Simple yet safe. Genuine vegetable parchment paper. 100% Biodegradable formula with French pulp. Paper made in France, shaped/packed in Korea. STURDY, NO LEAK, NON-STICKY AND SUPER EASY CLEANUP – Designed to increase durability against water and oil. No holes, extremely simple, convenient, waterproof and grease-proof material that keeps airfryer free from food residue. Less dishwashing for you. MEDIUM SIZE, MULTI-PURPOSE PREMIUM QUALITY BOWL SHAPED PARCHMENT PAPER – 11.4 inches (28.8 cm) when UNFOLDED. W8\" x H1.8\" (W20cm x H4.5cm) Rounded corner shape. Choose the size based on your airfryer’s base size. Ideal for airfryer, yet many versatile uses, including: baking, roasting, steaming and even serving. Perfect gift idea! CAUTION - Our parchment paper is safe up to 428℉ (220 ℃) for 2 hours. Parchment paper is flammable so please use with caution and use the correct size similar to air fryer basket and always use with enough food weighing down the parchment paper. Otherwise, it may fly around when the hot air circulates. Also it may catch on fire by touching the heating coil. To prevent a fire, please do not use pre-heat mode without enough food. Please keep out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ed4xN5KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HanDol","source_asin":"B08RCKFBMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RCKFBMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RCKFBMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
