window.products.push({"id":806435,"name":"Laramaid 2.5oz 20Packs Glass Jars Set, Cylinder Spice Jars with Bamboo Lids and Customized Labels, Food Storage Container Canisters for Home Kitchen, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8120ffk5unL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ HEALTHY CHOICE: LARAMAID glass jar set is made of high-quality borosilicate glass with smooth and beautifully polished Bamboo Lids. Each lid has a removable sealing ring, which can effectively isolate moisture and keep the ingredients dry and fresh. No need to worry about spices, herbs and ingredients going bad! ✅ ECO-FRIENDLY PRODUCT: The silicon seal is 100% BPA-free. The glass jars are microwave and dishwasher safe. All parts of our jars and packaging can be recycled! The lids are made of real wood, expect some grain and color variation which makes each lid unique. To preserve natural woods shine and look, we recommend to only hand wash lids. ✅ MINIMALIST DESIGN: The stained wooden lid gives the glass jars a natural, modern aesthetic that you can effortlessly integrate into your home decor. Leave them in the pantry or out on the kitchen counter. ✅ PREMIUM QUALITY LABELS: Not all labels are built the same. All our labels are printed on Laramaid proprietary Vinyl material which is long-lasting and more durable compared to industry leading products. We stand behind our superior quality by providing lifetime guarantee for all our labels. Each Set Comes with 10 blank labels and 96 expiration date labels. ✅ 6-MONTH WARRANTY: Shop confidently, we will replace any defects or damaged glasses caused in transit, please feel free to reach out to us if you have any questions or issues with our product. We promise to give you a 100% satisfied shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8120ffk5unL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laramaid","source_asin":"B0BXYR97HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXYR97HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXYR97HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806436,"name":"4 PCS Home Wall Decor Signs, IDATOO Rustic Wooden Living Room Hanging Decorations with Quotes THIS IS US/TOGETHER/BLESS THIS/FAMILY, Housewarming Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O8HKCdwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRING LIFE TO YOUR WALLS: Our wood wall signs will warm any wall of your house and make your family room feel welcoming and cozy. These warm quotes about family and making memories also look great on wood wall art. A warm saying on each art decoration for living room [This is us, our life, our story, our home]; [Together, is my favorite place to be]; [Bless this home, and all who enter]; [family, where life begins and love never ends]. HIGH QUALITY FINISHES&PREMIUM LONGEVITY: IDATOO 4 pieces home wall art decor can be easily wiped down, making the cleaning a breeze. The quotes are printed directly on the wood gives it a charming and traditional look for a more realistic effect. Sun fade resistant inks. This handcrafted wood plaque is made of high quality wood with premium printing inks which will not chip, peel, or fade. Each wall decor sign measures 15\" × 5.1\" and 0.2\". RUSTIC LOOK FOR ANY ROOM: The entire decorative wood wall decor is finished in a distressed wood color that gives off a rustic look and feel. This signage features a bold script font to give it that extra pop. The rustic design of our hanging wooden signs adds charm to any rooms, such as living room, kitchen, office, home, bedroom, bathroom, garage, barn, or themed room. EFFORTLESS INSTALLATION: Each living room wall decor is fitted with a clasp on each side at the back for an easy wall-mounting, so you can securely hang it to any wall or surface or leave it on a table leaning against a wall. You can complete the installation in 1 minutes. Besides, IDATOO vintage-inspired house sign is super lightweight and won't fell off easily. All materials are safe for your family and your kids. A BEST GIFT: Whether you're looking for cute wall decorations for yourself or a event, our wood wall art complements your home decor and adds your own touch. IDATOO wood wall art is a perfect housewarming gift for your family, best friends and colleague, this charming wood wall sign celebrates home with a casual yet cheery style. Share your love, Make each other closer. If there is any problem, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O8HKCdwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IDATOO","source_asin":"B0BQVZNT3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQVZNT3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQVZNT3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
