window.products.push({"id":806450,"name":"Zealude Entryway Rug 3x5 Persian Floral Area Rug Kitchen Rug Washable Bedside Rug Non Slip Front Door Mat Entrance Rug Indoor Carpet for Foyer Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hvmUnokQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zealude provides rugs available in a variety of sizes and color options to suit your personal style and preferences. Pick a Zealude area rug to your room for extra comfort and added style, bring a little cozier and snugger. Zealude caters to every situation with a wide range of rug sizes: 2x3 small rugs are functional and decorative, put one under a recliner to soften feet feeling, or in front of the washbasin to absorb the moisture. Runner rugs are excellent for long, narrow spaces. Add kitchen runner rugs near the sink for extra comfort while you prep meals and do dishes, hallway runners to reduce noise and protect floors in high traffic areas, or put it by the side of your bed to ease the cold of the floor. 3x5 rugs provide areas such as kitchen, front door, entryway. Or choose the 3x5 rug in the living room for a cozy apartment. Appropriate for indoor use only Pile height measures 0.4\" How to clean: Shake or beat: Take rugs outside and give them a good shake to remove any dirt and crumbs. Vacuum: Vacuum your rug to remove as much dust and debris as possible. Clean: Mix a capful of gentle detergent in the cold water and put the rug into the washing machine. Dry: Hang up the rug to dry outside or in a well-ventilated room, Let the rug dry thoroughly before bringing it back inside. Note: Avoid prolonged exposure to direct sunlight as this may cause fading of the color. How to eliminate the creases: Let the rug lie flat upon arrival, reverse rolling the rug can help to reduce wrinkles and curling from packing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hvmUnokQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zealude","source_asin":"B09MCLQNN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MCLQNN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MCLQNN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
