window.products.push({"id":806470,"name":"AUXCO 2500W Steam Cleaner, High Pressure Steamer for Cleaning, Handheld Portable Steam Cleaners for Home Use, Steamer for Car Detailing, Steam Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIR1jdbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful and Efficient Steamer for Cleaning】This high temperature steamer can emit 105℃（221℉）high pressured flow of steam blast that is excessively powerful to deeply clean out the hard, sticky grease easily and thoroughly! Meanwhile, this handheld steam cleaner release about 3 BAR of high pressure steam, which is equivalent to 6 kg of pressure acting on 1 cm². This steam cleaner for upholstery does save your time and boost your efficiency! Do not let go of any dead corner! 【15s Fast Heating, No Waiting!】Just aim the steamer at the stain, then turn on the power button and wait for about 15 seconds! The steamer for cleaning will spray strong pressured steam up to 105℃, instead of a long 3-4mins wait for heating. Further more, AUXCO steam cleaner for car keeps heating while using to maintain its heat and keep the steam strong and continuous, which is different from other steam cleaners for home use that need a break every 2 minutes to reheat and rebuild the pressure. 【Multi-Use Steam Cleaner】Are you looking for a high pressure steam cleaner to use for multiple areas? Our steam cleaner is a good choice for you. Not only this handheld steamer is used for cleaning away the dirty and stains on the kitchen, bathroom, floor, grout, tile, carpet, but also can serve for car detailing, which will save you a ton more on car wash! With 3 different brush heads, this furniture steam cleaner is also suitable for cleaning various surfaces such as stoves, walls, sofa,etc. 【1L Large Water Tank】Want a helpful and efficient steam cleaner for grout and tile? Go get this handheld steam cleaner with a bigger tank! This steamer for cleaning features a large water tank of 1000ml capacity which allows you to focus on cleaning, instead of refilling often. Besides, the tank supports adding water during working, so that the portable steam cleaners for home use can keep working for longer cleaning time. Say goodbye to small capacity and refuse to add water many times! 【Portable & Lightweight】 AUXCO steam cleaners for home use is easy to carry from one place to another place with lightweight and portable body. You only need to hold the steam gun when cleaning. No need to hold the heavy water tank all the time and no more hand fatigue. And portable unit comes with 2.2m steam pipe and 2.5m power cord for convenient indoor and outdoor use. This upgraded steamer for car detailing will help you to do cleaning with ease! 【Kindly Reminder】 To avoid burned, please wear gloves and ensure that the waterproof washer is properly installed to avoid air and water leaks. Refrain from unscrewing the hose unless necessary. In case of unscrewing, it is necessary to open the plastic cover and tighten it from inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIR1jdbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUXCO","source_asin":"B0BZ48Y7WV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ48Y7WV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ48Y7WV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
