window.products.push({"id":806570,"name":"Dash SmartStore™ Deluxe Compact Electric Hand Mixer + Whisk and Milkshake Attachment for Whipping, Mixing Cookies, Brownies, Cakes, Dough, Batters, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UuXj9WQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compact and lightweight, the SmartStore™ Hand Mixer is perfect for everyday mixing with optimal power and minimal fuss. The sleek design allows for convenient storage in any standard kitchen drawer, and beaters clip into the side of the appliance when not in use. 3-speed functionality is perfect for a range of baking projects, from mixing to whipping, and the beaters eject at the touch of a button for easy cleaning. The Deluxe version includes Whisk Attachment and Milkshake attachment, perfect for making milkshakes, whipped cream, meringue, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UuXj9WQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DASH","source_asin":"B08XSRY2GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XSRY2GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XSRY2GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806571,"name":"Professional blender, juicers, suitable for milkshakes and smoothies, etc., with 6 sharp blades with high power motor 1000 watts, large capacity 1.75 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kWxWg3EUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Nutri Blendicook has been designed to create Soups,Steam Food and blend all kinds of vegetable and fruits.It is fitted with several safety features including an interlocking lid cut-out;temperature sensor;and a safety micro-switch cut-off on the motor base. The built in blender blades can also be used to allow the Nutri Blendicook to be used solely as a blender to make smoothies,purees,dips and dressings. Before using the Mutri Blendicook for the first time wipe down the jug and lid with a damp cloth using a mild detergent. Caution:The jug contains very sharp blades and should be handled with care at all times.Do not immerse the unit or jug in water or any other liquids. Place the base unit of Nutri Blendicook on a heat-resistant,stable surface.Carefully position the jug on the base unit aligning the connections in the base of the jug handle with those in the base unit.The jug should sit securely on top of the base unit.Fit the lid to the Nutri Blendicook by aligning the lock open symbol on the lid to the handle.Ensure the measuring cup is fitted to the top of the lid.When everything is positioned is correctly,connect the Nutri Blendicook to the mains power supply and press the Start/Stop button to turn the Nutri Blendicook on.The button will illuminate indicating the it is on.If at this point the alarm sounds,take the jug off the base and disconnect the Nutri Blendicook from the mains power supply and check that the lid is properly fitted.Once checked,reconnect to the mains and power up.To start the cooking process,choose either soup functions based on how much soup you want to make or other function you want.The above pre-set programs rely on uninterrupted operation Any interruption will result in the cancellation of the program.Restarting will result in the cooking stages being repeated which may affect the finished result.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kWxWg3EUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"通用","source_asin":"B092ZKKZCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092ZKKZCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092ZKKZCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
