window.products.push({"id":806600,"name":"Official The Office That’s What She Said 20-Ounce Mug - Ceramic Cup For Hot Coffee, Tea, Cocoa - Every That's What She Said Joke from All Seasons - Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GeGzAxUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring home a little bit of that The Office spirit with this fun, charming coffee mug, featuring some of the best lines to ever come out of the Dunder Mifflin Paper Company! Ever since its debut in 2005, The Office has held a special place in American popular culture, and you’d be hard pressed to go anywhere without running across an iconic quote or reference along the way! This mug features several quotes from the classic television show, The Office! If you look on the bottom, you’ll find a surprise quote of the iconic line “That’s what she said!” Perfect for using around the house, at the office, at parties, and more... Officially licensed NBC merchandise! The Office is an American sitcom television series that depicts the everyday lives of office employees in the Scranton, Pennsylvania branch of the fictional Dunder Mifflin Paper Company. It aired on NBC from March 24, 2005, to May 16, 2013, lasting a total of nine seasons. It is an adaptation of the original BBC series of the same name and was adapted for American television by Greg Daniels, a veteran writer for Saturday Night Live, King of the Hill, and The Simpsons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GeGzAxUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toynk","source_asin":"B08235XY5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08235XY5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08235XY5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806601,"name":"Gold Chinese dragon wall fan - hand painted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415Z5A1EDNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Chinese dragons represent good fortune, prosperity and the energy of life itself. Chinese art often depicts a dragon surrounded by clouds, demonstrating its celestial power. Because the Dragon's domain is in the clouds they are thought to bring the rains needed for a fruitful harvest and are an auspicious symbol of impending prosperity. In Feng Shui dragons are protectors and convert bad energy into good Chi. Hang a picture of a dragon to help promote more Yang energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415Z5A1EDNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reorient","source_asin":"B000LYAZ7I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LYAZ7I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LYAZ7I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806602,"name":"Sunland Artisans Spiral Sun - Twelve Points Metal Indoor/Outdoor Wall Art - 12 inches - Rust Finish - Made in Arizona, USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oAqTce4eL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"This rustic 12-inch small 12-Ray Spiral Sun 3D Metal Wall Art in a rich rust finish measures approximately 12in H x 12in W x 0.5in D. This unique Southwestern Decor wall art piece is meticulously plasma-cut from high quality steel that is expertly finished and clear coated to last a lifetime. A joy to own or give as a gift, this indoor/outdoor Southwestern hanging art piece is created in Arizona, USA for Sunland Artisans, a collaboration of nearby skilled artists. It includes a built-in sawtooth hook for easy mounting and adjusting. The metal is cut out into this original design, which gives a 3D effect when hung on the wall. It is then treated to give an amazing color and texture. Clear-coating makes this the perfect weather-resistant outdoor wall decoration. It is best displayed under the protection of and eave or overhang; perfect for patio. It will also weather rustically if displayed exposed to the elements (sun and rain). Proudly made in America. Contains the predominate color(s): Rust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oAqTce4eL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunland Artisans","source_asin":"B07BKPXMMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BKPXMMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BKPXMMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806603,"name":"Staub American Grill Pan Cast Iron Suitable for Induction Cookers 26 cm Cherry Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":130.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TiJYoBQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cherry red, square US grill pan from STAUB is ideal for roasting meat. The bottom of the pan has grooves that give the meat an attractive pattern like the grill. These grooves also have the purpose of draining excess grease. In the grill pan from STAUB you can therefore fry your meat very fat and thus low calories. It is suitable for all types of cookers, including induction. The square grill pan has a size of 26 x 26 cm. STAUB produces its pans made of cast iron, because this material is particularly suitable for searing and produces fine roasting flavours. In addition, the pan is roughly enamelled so that nothing can burn. Even beginners can therefore effortlessly make a juicy steak in such a pan. Thanks to the high quality materials, STAUB grill pans are very robust, durable and at the same time easy to clean. They also look good and are therefore also used for serving. In this practical griddle pan you can prepare juicy steaks or delicious hamburgers for yourself and your family. Whatever your palate desires, it will taste like fresh from the grill. Tips for Preventing Rust Never soak the pan: Since cast iron is so vulnerable to rust, it’s best to limit your pan’s exposure to water as much as possible. Never soak the pan: Since cast iron is so vulnerable to rust, it’s best to limit your pan’s exposure to water as much as possible. Don’t let the pan air dry: Wipe off any excess water with a towel immediately after rinsing. To get your skillet bone dry, pop it on the burner to remove extra moisture Don’t let the pan air dry: Wipe off any excess water with a towel immediately after rinsing. To get your skillet bone dry, pop it on the burner to remove extra moisture Lightly oil after use: Once dried, rub your skillet with a thin layer of vegetable oil before storing Lightly oil after use: Once dried, rub your skillet with a thin layer of vegetable oil before storing Seasoning: Drop a tablespoon of vegetable oil on the pan/utensil and spread it around with your fingers or a paper towel. (Take care not to burn yourself on a warm skillet!). Oil the outside and the handle, too. Next, take a folded napkin and wipe off the excess oil. You’ll want the skillet to be lightly greased. Set your oven to 350 degrees and put some aluminum foil on the bottom rack. Then pop the skillet in, upside down, on the upper rack for about 1 hour. Turn the oven off and leave the pan inside until it’s cool. The oil will bake into the pores of the pan, providing a non-stick finish Seasoning: Drop a tablespoon of vegetable oil on the pan/utensil and spread it around with your fingers or a paper towel. (Take care not to burn yourself on a warm skillet!). Oil the outside and the handle, too. Next, take a folded napkin and wipe off the excess oil. You’ll want the skillet to be lightly greased. Set your oven to 350 degrees and put some aluminum foil on the bottom rack. Then pop the skillet in, upside down, on the upper rack for about 1 hour. Turn the oven off and leave the pan inside until it’s cool. The oil will bake into the pores of the pan, providing a non-stick finish","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TiJYoBQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAUB","source_asin":"B0B59K7MD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B59K7MD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B59K7MD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
