window.products.push({"id":806627,"name":"Duo Pack Instant Read Food and Meat Digital Thermometer and Grilling Glove - Auto-Off Feature, Power Saving and Backlight Function - Food Grade Safe 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mwjcBGU0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>👉 [FAST AND PRECISE TEMPERATURE READING] Featuring an ultra-fast response between 3 - 4 s and a great accuracy, this instant read food thermometer is a must-have in every kitchen. Also, you get a cooking glove for added safety and professional results.</p> <p>👉 [VERSATILE AND MULTIUSE] Use our wireless meat thermometer indoors or outdoors, at your kitchen, in BBQs, picnics, and family reunions. With auto-off function when folded, and a useful bottle opener for your cold drinks. With internal magnets for holding and carrying with comfort.</p> <p>👉 [HIGH-QUALITY ECO-FRIENDLY MATERIALS] The body is made in ABS Eco-friendly Plastic and the probe in food safe 304 stainless steel, very reliable and durable. The included Cooking glove will protect you from high temperature, taking care of your hands and clothing when frying or baking on the oven.</p> <p>👉 [GREAT COOKING AND GRILLING TOOL] No more guessing temperatures when cooking your favorite meals. This precise tool will help you to achieve the perfect cook point in your meat. Also great for baking, making candy and beverages.</p> <p>👉 [NICE GIFT FOR A GOOD FRIEND WHO LIKES TO COOK] For that friend, relative or coworker who always like to have a BBQ, a dinner or family reunions. Includes a practical grilling guide with the correct temperature and cooking time for many delicious meals.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mwjcBGU0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRILLNOVATIONS","source_asin":"B09R2BX1LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R2BX1LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R2BX1LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
