window.products.push({"id":806893,"name":"CASA LINGO Pantry Organization and Storage, Pasta Containers for Pantry Kitchen, Set of 4 Plastic Airtight Food Storage Containers with Lid for Bulk F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hAC2BMUGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉CASA LINGO food storage containers are perfect for organize your kitchen and pantry：With the stackable design, these different size plastic storage containers will make more efficient use of every inch of your home kitchen. Make your kitchen or pantry neatly organized and beautiful. Whether you have a large or small pantry, these durable containers will help you organize your kitchen and pantry better. 👉Rectangular horizontal Storage Desigh -- Our pasta storage containers can lay horizontally from front to back of the cabinet instead of standing upright, which avoids things getting lost at the back of the shelf and keep every item close to the front. Perfect for not large but deep cabinets. So clever to have your long pasta lay flat, so you can just reach right in and grab a handful and will not see them breaking into tiny spaghetti pieces 👉4 liters of capacity: The suitable storage size fulfill your storage needs: Includes 4 rectangular horizontal Containers. These kitchen storage containers are Large enough for 8lbs spaghetti or 6pound sugar. Also perfect for pasta, fettuccine, lasagna noodles, angel hair, linguini, fusilli, farfalle, garganelli, macaroni, cereals, snacks and many kinds of dry food and baking supplies, such as flour, sugar, rice, grain, chips, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea. 👉New safety seal design and lock design: Leakproof 4-hinge locking system forms an airtight, watertight seal between container and lid, which can always keep your food dry and fresh. The new lock design avoids breaking as easily as the traditional design, which extends the service life of the storage containers. 4 containers have the same lids make it easy to identify and combine. So you don’t have to worry about not being able to find a cover of the corresponding container. 👉Durable high quality & 100% BPA free: CASA LINGO food storage containers made of durable high quality 100% food safe BPA free plastic. Come with 1 Measuring cup with handle, chalkboard Labels and 1 chalkboard pen. Let us enjoy a kitchen or pantry neatly organized and beautiful!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hAC2BMUGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA LINGO","source_asin":"B09P1KK246","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P1KK246","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P1KK246","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806894,"name":"Hydration Collective Thermos Water Bottle – Leakproof Smart with Tea Infuser and LED Temperature Display Anti-Slip Stainless Steel Rubberized Matte Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f1EhWQ-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hydration Collective focuses on developing smart and practical accessories whose purpose is to promote excellent well-being and an active routine for people worldwide. We harness the benefits of top-notch technology, carefully selected materials and innovative designs to create a diverse collection of water bottles that will assist you in all your endeavors, outdoor adventures, sports sessions and routine, making sure you are hydrated and energized at all times. We don’t compromise on aesthetics, durability, or your convenience! Insulated Water Bottle – Taking Hydration to the Next Level This thermos bottle is a must-have for active people, athletes, outdoor enthusiasts, or men and women who are always on the go and need a simple and effective solution to stay hydrated or enjoy their favorite beverages at optimal conditions. Our 6-layer insulated water bottle is equipped with a leakproof lid to prevent accidental spills and keep your coffee, tea, water, juice, at the right temperature for up to 12 hours. The water bottle is sleek and modern, thanks to the rubberized matte finish and elegant design, but also smart and practical, featuring a LED display on the lid that tells you the temperature of your drinks. Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product: - Premium 304 stainless steel - Anti-slip bottom; - Superior thermal insulation for up to 12 hours; - Leakproof lid with BPA-free silicone ring; - Smart LED display for temperature in Fahrenheit; - Exquisite matte finish; - Easy grip and comfortable hand feeling; - Includes a tea filter; Stay hydrated while reaching your goals with our insulated water bottle!PRECAUTIONS: Before use, make sure to wash the thermos, tea filter, and lid with soap and water. Do not wash the lid in the dishwasher as this may cause the LED display to malfunction. DO NOT microwave the lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f1EhWQ-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hydration Collective","source_asin":"B09FZTHVW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FZTHVW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FZTHVW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
