window.products.push({"id":806903,"name":"JAXSUNNY End Table with Charging Station, Narrow Flip Top Side Table with Storage and USB Ports and Outlets, Bedside Table Night Stand for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/B1PLQ35Z-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💐【Modern Farmhouse Style】The JAXSUNNY small side table look is paired with grey toned farm colors for an exciting style combination. This attractive narrow nightstand can be moved around and used as a side table in the living room, as a bedside table in the bedroom, or as your work desk. ☕【End the Mess of Daily Life】 JAXSUNNY side table with storage is half a drawer and half a flip top and storage space. This design allows you to easily access what you want from both ends of the table. The slim end table adds a functional point to your bedroom, living room and office. 💡【More Strong X-Side Design】Made from high-density particleboard with easy-to-clean melamine overlays, X-shaped metal supports, and non-slip feet, the skinny table top can hold 66 lbs and the bottom shelf can hold 44 lbs, ensuring a stable stand . Dimensions: 23.62\"L x 11.02\"W x 23.82\"H. 🔌【Power Your Phone and Laptop】Flip open the top of the farmhouse end table to reveal a hidden charging area, including 2 standard plug sockets and 2 USB ports, ETL certified. Cable length of 6.5 feet. The side of the coffee table has grooves for easy charging and tidying up clutter. 🔧【Easy Assembly & Excellent After-sales Services】According to the detailed manual and labeled parts, you can quickly assemble the flip-top tall end table. If you have any issues, please contact us, our experienced customer service team will reply as soon as possible within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/B1PLQ35Z-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAXSUNNY","source_asin":"B09Z2RCNG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2RCNG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2RCNG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806904,"name":"Deep Clean, Scrub Free Cleanser for Espro Press Filters with 1 tbsp. Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ah-qnhrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Espro Deep Clean is one of the best ways to clean your favorite Espro Press or French Press coffee maker. Espro partnered with Urnex to create this special formula which can be used for the recommended monthly deep cleans of your coffee gear to remove any solids that have built up. Deep Clean is the easiest and scrub-free way to keep your Espro or French press in top shape. A monthly clean with Deep Clean removes small particles of coffee, tea, or milk that can block your filter and ruin its performance. It also removes stale oils and tastes that can damage the flavor of your coffee or tea. Deep Clean's special formula cleans even the most complex and delicate microfilters without having to scrub them. Deep Clean works on both etched and woven microfilters to restore them to an almost brand new condition again. After years of testing, Espro devised this made in the USA formula with the beverage cleaning specialist Urnex to be a completely scrub-free cleaner. How To Clean A Espro Press or a French Press Cleaning Espro Press is easy with Deep Clean. Simply mix one tablespoon (15 g.) of Espro Deep Clean with warm water (500 ml.) until it's dissolved. Soak your filter in the mixture for 30 min. and watch your coffee, tea, or milk particles dissolve before your very eyes. Then rinse your filter out (and carafe) with clean water and pop it back into the press. Now you can begin brewing again and get back to enjoying an optimal cup of coffee or tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ah-qnhrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESPRO","source_asin":"B079GN2SWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079GN2SWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079GN2SWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
