window.products.push({"id":806918,"name":"Sapid Nonstick Rolling Pin Silicone Baking Mat Set, Adjustable Stainless Steel Dough Roller with Removable Thickness Rings, Non-Slip Thick Pastry Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaLEJFzSL._AC_SL1173_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Materials】: Sapid rolling pin is made of SUS 304 stainless steel , which is 100% meet the food grade criterion. The materials of the hollow dough roller is premium and thick, it will not be rust. The silicone pastry mat is made of fiberglass, which doesn’t include the vulcanizing agent and safe for food. 【Perfect Thickness Rings】: Our adjustable rolling pins(15.8”×1.5”) and pastry baking mat(15.7''×19.7'') both are designed with inches and mm measurements, it’s super convenient to use. And 3 different sizes of the removable silicone thickness rings(2mm, 3mm, 5mm) are used to rolled out the even thickness pastry. 【Nonstick and Nonslip】: Thanks to the superior stainless steel pizza dough roller has an incredible smooth surface, the dough will not stick on it. The non-stick pie mat surface no need to use excess oil and less scraping. This nonskid pastry mats also can lay flat on the countertop perfectly when you rolling out the dough. 【Easy Home Baking】: This dough roller has cooling function, and lighter than the marble stone. Just chilled the pastry roller in the freezer before using, which can prevent dough too hot. Our dough rolling mat also withstand temperature from -30 to 480°F. This combo is quite perfect for baking pizza, bread, pie, biscuit, cookies, pasta, dumpling. 【Easy Clean & Store】: The SUS 304 stainless steel is waterproof and without rust. For the dishwasher safe pie crust mat also just rinsed it by warm soapy water and let air dried. Used the silicon mat roll up the dough roller, it is super easy to store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaLEJFzSL._AC_SL1173_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAPID","source_asin":"B088RD9C17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088RD9C17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088RD9C17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
