window.products.push({"id":806939,"name":"Gift for Her, Women's Gift Birthday Gifts, Beauty and The Beast Rose Flowers, LED Lights in Glass Dome on Wood Base, Warm Light Mode, Graduation Gift,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVk8zTchL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤️BEAUTY AND THE BEAST ROSE KIT - The roses are perfectly and eternally stored in glass domes. The Glass dome is highly transparent and flawless. The base is made of stable and smooth black wood without splinters. Both glass and wood base are easy to clean. Amazing centerpiece in your living room or bedroom. ❤️HANDMADE DIY HOME DECOR - Rose kit size is 4.33\" x H 8.54\". Real glass cover allows LED light to shine brighter than plastic cover, resists yellowing & discoloration, easier to clean. The tiny LED lights are twined around the rose and fallen petals. Warm white LED light illuminates the entire glass dome and the surroundings and gives us a romantic atmosphere. ❤️A ROMANTIC GIFT IDEA - Our colorful gold foil rose glass rose is not only a nice household decoration, but also a perfect gift for your family, lovers, classmates or friends. Perfect for housewarming party, birthday, graduation party, bridal shower, wedding, Christmas gift, anniversary gifts, appreciation, housewarming gift, and homecoming presents. Good-looking and practical. ❤️MULTIPURPOSE ROSE - Our Glass Dome Rose decor can make Thanksgiving and Christmas days warm and welcoming to your guests. Place them in the kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom, hallway, planters, cafes, bars, bistros, bakeries and indoor garden, dining room wall or anywhere you want. ❤️Birthday gifts for women, valentines day gifts for her, bridesmaid gifts, anniversary gifts for wife, valentine gift, valentines day gifts for her naughty, gift for girlfriend romantic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVk8zTchL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream of Flowers","source_asin":"B07TG17685","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TG17685","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TG17685","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":806940,"name":"Paladone Overwatch Logo Light-Ideal for Kids Bedrooms, Office, Home-Pop Culture Gaming Merchandise, White and Orange, 8 x 2 x 24 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFgravAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brighten up your bedroom, study, or games room with this fun and stylish 3D Over watch Logo Light. Standing at approximately 25cm tall the lamp is in the design of the logo from the iconic video game Over watch. The round lamp is battery or USB powered and lights up in bright white and orange. The black base of the lamp also features the word Over watch in the game's official font. This lamp is an ideal gift for Over watch fans as well as gamers, and is ideal for Christmas and birthdays. Over watch is a team-based multiplayer video game released in May 2016 for PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Windows. Developed and published by Blizzard Entertainment, this first-person shooter game assigns players into two teams of six. Each player then selects a role from a group of over 20 characters, known as 'heroes', before battle commences. In its first year of release the game made over 1 billion in revenue and after two years more than 40 million people were playing it. Over watch is also considered to be one of the greatest video games of all time, having won a number of prestigious accolades over the years. The Over watch Logo Light is an officially licensed Over watch product. This product is made using BDP which stands for Breakdown Plastic - an organic additive that helps plastic decompose at landfill without affecting either it's structural integrity (before landfill) or the recyclability of the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFgravAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paladone","source_asin":"B07T478PGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-806940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T478PGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T478PGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
